{
  "_doc": "The Frostspine props, generated by a script (yaw degrees, 0 faces +z north, 90 faces +x east; glTF +Z is each mtn_* model's front). Set pieces: the rope bridge over the Rimecleft at (404, 2250) spanning x 384..424 at the Eyrie Shelf's height, the watchtower ruin at (470, 2262) with its door west, mtn_steps on the three flights of the Switchback Stair (each 3 m run rises 1.5 m, the terrain is shaped 1:2 under them), mtn_fence on the drop side of the gentle trail sections. mtn_peak_a/b stand along the north and west edges as the world wall; mtn_cliff_a/b are laid where the baked ground is steep. Scatter: pines below the treeline (~140 m; north and west high ground is above it), wildflowers and boulders on the meadows (Lowpine, Tarnhollow, the Eyrie Shelf, the Old Watch), snow drifts on the high ground. Marks: mountains_start on the trail in Tarnhollow, looking north at the stair, gorge and tower.",
